e], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "unload_after"}, "shape": 7, "name": "unload_after", "label": "unload_after", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "unload_after"}], "flags": {}, "id": 9, "type": "Qwen3ASRLoader", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Qwen3ASRLoader"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "audio", "links": [41], "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "size": [400, 382], "pos": [1579.2462158203125, 57.331912994384766], "widgets_values": ["LongCat-AudioDiT-3.5B-bf16", "The sun glows warmly in a cloudless blue sky, a soft breeze drifts through the air, and birds fill the world with gentle, cheerful songs. Everything feels alive with beauty, just waiting to be discovered.", "", 40, 4, "apg", "auto", "bf16", "auto", 78613290, "fixed", true], "inputs": [{"name": "prompt_audio", "link": 13, "label": "prompt_audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "prompt_audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_path"}, "name": "model_path", "label": "model_path", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_path"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 14, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt_text"}, "name": "prompt_text", "link": 10, "label": "prompt_text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt_text"}, {"widget": {"name": "steps"}, "name": "steps", "label": "steps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "steps"}, {"widget": {"name": "guidance_strength"}, "name": "guidance_strength", "label": "guidance_strength", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "guidance_strength"}, {"widget": {"name": "guidance_method"}, "name": "guidance_method", "label": "guidance_method", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "guidance_method"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "device"}, {"widget": {"name": "dtype"}, "name": "dtype", "label": "dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "dtype"}, {"widget": {"name": "attention"}, "name": "attention", "label": "attention", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "attention"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}], "flags": {}, "id": 14, "type": "LongCatVoiceCloneTTS", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LongCatVoiceCloneTTS"}, "order": 22}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [270, 136], "pos": [2045.354736328125, 48.85057067871094], "widgets_values": ["Voice-Clone", "V0"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 41, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "quality"}, "name": "quality", "label": "quality", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quality"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}], "flags": {}, "id": 32, "type": "SaveAudioMP3", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudioMP3"}, "order": 24}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [16, 22], "label": "AUDIO", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "AUDIO"}], "size": [301.97235107421875, 136], "pos": [435.9317626953125, 605.8385620117188], "widgets_values": ["87e1ba134c8aa68a35560f5075dddcc46a5f0037d0fad98d1d63c3d46ad3acfc.mp3", null, null], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "audio"}, "name": "audio", "label": "audio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "AUDIOUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 17, "type": "LoadAudio", "title": "Speaker_1", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.17.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadAudio"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [{"name": "prompt_list", "links": [], "label": "prompt_list", "type": "LIST", "localized_name": "prompt_list"}, {"shape": 6, "name": "prompt_strings", "links": [], "label": "prompt_strings", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt_strings"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["今天我们来聊一个最近很值得关注的语音模型，LongCat-AudioDiT。它不是那种只会把文字念出来的普通 TTS，而是更强调 naturalness、speaker similarity，还有 multi-speaker dialogue 的控制能力。简单来说，如果你想在 ComfyUI 里做播客、角色对白、模型介绍，甚至是 zero-shot voice cloning，这个模型就很有测试价值。它的重点不只是“能说”，而是说出来像不像真人，情绪稳不稳，长文本会不会崩，以及中英文 mixed content 的处理是否自然。这也是为什么很多人开始拿它和传统 autoregressive TTS 做对比。", "如果你最近在找一个能在 ComfyUI 里直接跑、而且听感比较自然的语音模型，那你真的可以试一下 LongCat-AudioDiT。它最吸引我的地方，不是参数多大，而是生成出来的 voice 真的更像人在说话，尤其是一些介绍类、安利类、storytelling 风格的短视频文案，会明显比那种很机械的 TTS 更有 vibe。你可以拿它测模型解说、角色配音、双人对话，甚至是带一点 English words 的混合文本。说白了，它不是完美，但它很适合做“先出效果”的工作流测试。", "你知道吗，我原本以为我已经不在乎了，真的，我甚至告诉自己，forget it，let it go，就当一切都没有发生过。可是一到深夜，我还是会想起你说话的声音，想起你站在门口回头看我的那一秒，想起你明明什么都没承诺，却让我一个人把未来想得那么远。我不是舍不得输，我只是突然觉得，原来我认真过，原来我真的把你放进过心里。你可以不爱我，你可以离开，你甚至可以一句解释都不给，可你不能假装那些瞬间从来没有存在过。因为对你来说，也许只是 a moment，可对我来说，那是整整一段 life。", "[speaker_1]: 欢迎来到今天的 AI Audio Talk，今天我们想聊一个最近讨论度很高的模型，LongCat-AudioDiT。\n[speaker_2]: 对，它现在在 ComfyUI 圈子里挺火，因为很多人发现它不只是能做普通 TTS，还能做 zero-shot voice cloning 和 multi-speaker dialogue。\n[speaker_1]: 而且它比较有意思的一点是，大家测的不只是发音准不准，而是它的 naturalness、情绪稳定性，还有长文本生成会不会漂。\n[speaker_2]: 没错，尤其是做播客、角色对白、模型介绍这种内容的时候，你会很在意它听起来像不像真人，而不是像一个把字念完的机器。\n[speaker_1]: 还有一个重点，就是 mixed language 的表现。比如中文里夹一点 English technical terms，它到底是自然切过去，还是会突然断掉节奏。\n[speaker_2]: 所以如果你是拿它做内容生产，我建议不要只听一句 demo，要拿长文本、多人对话，还有不同参考音频一起测，结论才会靠谱。", "[speaker_1]: 我今天把你们都约出来，不是想演一场 drama，我只是觉得，有些话再不说清楚，最后受伤的人会更多。\n[speaker_2]: 你现在才说这种话，不觉得太晚了吗？你明明知道我喜欢你很久了，可你每次给我的，都是那种 almost love 的错觉。\n[speaker_3]: 我本来不想来，可我也不想再被蒙在鼓里。你对她说过的话，你也对我说过。你说你需要时间，可你其实是在两个答案之间摇摆。\n[speaker_1]: 我承认，是我处理得很差。我以为只要不正式开始，就不算真正伤害谁，可现在我知道我错了。\n[speaker_2]: 你错的不是犹豫，你错的是明明靠近了，却又后退，明明让我相信了，又在最后一秒说你没有准备好。\n[speaker_3]: 最可笑的是，我甚至不是因为输给她才难过，我只是突然发现，在你这里，我和她都没有被认真坚定地选择过。\n[speaker_1]: 如果道歉还有意义，我想说，对不起。不是为了让你们原谅我，而是因为这一次，我终于不想再逃避了。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "optional_prompt_list", "label": "optional_prompt_list", "type": "LIST", "localized_name": "optional_prompt_list"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt_1"}, "name": "prompt_1", "label": "prompt_1", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt_1"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt_2"}, "name": "prompt_2", "label": "prompt_2", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt_2"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt_3"}, "name": "prompt_3", "label": "prompt_3", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt_3"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt_4"}, "name": "prompt_4", "label": "prompt_4", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt_4"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt_5"}, "name": "prompt_5", "label": "prompt_5", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt_5"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy promptList", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [406.0674133300781, 730.5181274414062], "pos": [-377.7352600097656, 3.280449867248535], "id": 4, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy promptList"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [28], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["[speaker_1]: 我今天把你们都约出来，不是想演一场 drama，我只是觉得，有些话再不说清楚，最后受伤的人会更多。\n[speaker_2]: 你现在才说这种话，不觉得太晚了吗？你明明知道我喜欢你很久了，可你每次给我的，都是那种 almost love 的错觉。\n[speaker_3]: 我本来不想来，可我也不想再被蒙在鼓里。你对她说过的话，你也对我说过。你说你需要时间，可你其实是在两个答案之间摇摆。\n[speaker_1]: 我承认，是我处理得很差。我以为只要不正式开始，就不算真正伤害谁，可现在我知道我错了。\n[speaker_2]: 你错的不是犹豫，你错的是明明靠近了，却又后退，明明让我相信了，又在最后一秒说你没有准备好。\n[speaker_3]: 最可笑的是，我甚至不是因为输给她才难过，我只是突然发现，在你这里，我和她都没有被认真坚定地选择过。\n[speaker_1]: 如果道歉还有意义，我想说，对不起。不是为了让你们